Package: imap-exporter
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, openssl, ca-certificates, hicolor-icon-theme, pkexec
Maintainer: Eduardo Henrique Silva Teixeira <contato@eduhcommerce.com.br>
Homepage: https://github.com/ehstbr/IMAP-Exporter
Description: Synchronize and analyze email metadata over IMAP
 IMAP Exporter synchronizes message headers, reconciles local metadata with
 the server, ranks senders, domains, large messages and attachments, supports
 controlled cleanup, and exports data to CSV or ODS. A lightweight on-demand
 reader displays text parts and downloads selected attachments without
 storing message content in its database.
